---
import Header from "@components/header.astro";
import "@styles/global.module.css";
import Scripts from "@components/scripts.astro";
import Footer from "@components/footer.astro";
import Meta from "@components/meta.astro";
import Cursor from "@components/cursor.astro";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <Meta name="About me" description="Who I am, what I do and what I like/dislike" />
        <Scripts />
        <Cursor />
    </head>

    <body>
        <canvas id="background"></canvas>
        <!-- God damnit, I'm forced to use inline styles because Astro is stupid -->
        <div style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;">
            <Header />
            <main>
                <h1>About me</h1>

                <p><strong>Recommended that you read this before you interact with me.</strong></p>

                <h2>Do Not Interact</h2>

                <ul>
                    <li>If your entire purpose of interacting with me is for satisfaction purposes</li>
                    <li>If you're fascist, nazi, support MAPs, or you're a transphobic or homophobic bigot</li>
                </ul>

                <p>If you're mentioning jokes around me, please preferably mark them as such by using tone tags.</p>

                <h2>About Me</h2>
                <br />

                <p>
                    My name is Lunya. Refrain from using any of my older usernames, pronouns or similar. Tell me when I'm <i>too silly</i> for your comfort.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I&apos;m okay with flirting whenever you ask if it&apos;s okay and I answer yes. I&apos;m completely fine to flirt as friends, however I won&apos;t enter any relationships. I may feel safer to flirt with some people more
                    than with other people. I&apos;m pansexual, so I&apos;ll flirt regardless of what gender you are. I&apos;m also fine with using slurs when I know you for a while.
                </p>

                <p>
                    If you get me to know you enough, you can ask me and sign up on my <a href="/services">services</a>. I am fine with letting a few people sign up on my services.
                </p>

                <h2>What I like</h2>

                <ul>
                    <li>Women, fem-adjacent creatures and critters and other genders but a bit less</li>
                    <li>Yuri, women kissing and gay women in general</li>
                    <li><a href="https://git.lunya.pet/lunya">Making software</a>, and chatting about my projects</li>
                    <li>Free software, sometimes contributing to it</li>
                    <li>Linux (Arch Linux, my beloved)</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>What I dislike</h2>

                <ul>
                    <li>Corporates</li>
                </ul>

                <p><i>(This page may be expanded in the future, once I discover more things about myself.)</i></p>
            </main>

            <Footer />
        </div>
        <script is:inline src="/scripts/background.js"></script>
    </body>
</html>
